## Changelog Rules
    Separate every set of changes under its own version heading.
    List each change as a concise bullet point under its version.
    End each version section with a `Commit message:` line describing the commit.

## Changelog
Version 0.0.3

- Added weapon debug HUD output for state, ammunition, and fire/reload timers with configurable text scaling.
- Added weapon enable and disable state controls and tightened reload validation to only allow reloads from the ready state.
- Added firing animation transitions and configured weapon model muzzle and eject points in the test scene.
- Reduced the N66 reload time from 3 seconds to 2 seconds.
- Updated the test scene weapon presentation and regenerated its lighting and reflection data.

Commit message: Improve weapon debugging, animation, and scene setup

Version 0.0.2

- Added weapon firing and reload timing with state validation.
- Added magazine refill behavior when reloading completes.
- Added Input System bindings for firing and reloading.

Commit message: Add weapon firing and reload system

Version 0.0.1

- Updated the hierarchy styling editor tool to use Unity's EntityId-based hierarchy callback and object lookup APIs.
- Resolved obsolete Unity editor API compiler errors in StyleHierarchy.cs.

Commit message: Fix obsolete Unity hierarchy editor APIs
